\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {End-to-end HearthGen case study.} A vague community-style request is parsed into graph attributes, matched against faceted KG evidence, converted into a playable card design and LoRA caption, and rendered as Hearthstone-style artwork. For the 559 project, the central technical object is the semantic graph and retrieval over it; image generation demonstrates the complete application.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
