\newlabel{fig:semantic_kg}{{2}{4}{\textbf {Semantic KG neighborhood sampled from the real graph.} The card node ``Health'' Drink connects to typed semantic attributes such as class, card type, spell school, keyword, action, and target. User queries are mapped into the same attribute space, allowing graph retrieval to match gameplay semantics}{figure.2}{}}
